              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae nu ŋakiboisyo ŋuna apotu toruwor ŋuna eboiyoto ikes: Besel ka ŋirerya ŋulu erimokinito Besel kidiŋ, todoiyosi Kide neni anyaritae Naaran ka To neni anyaritae Geser ta ŋirerya ŋulu erimokinito ŋakiboisyo ŋun kidiŋ. Emoriyarit akibois kec tari ŋitaunio lu: Sekem ka Aya kaapei ka ŋirerya ŋulu aya nawaetin kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
