          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋitaunio lu ŋulu a ŋituŋa a Manase, ido ayakasi lokukworin kec ka ŋituŋa ŋuluce: Bes-San, Taanak, Megido ka Dor kaapei ka ŋirerya ŋulu aya nawaetin kec. Arae lotaunio ŋul iŋes eboiyoto ŋiletok a Yosepu a lokoku a Isirael.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
